(7706651, 1265695, 173844, '<td valign="top">This lovely image has the feeling of memory.  It fades into but a semblance, it''s there but ungraspable, it''s like the constant turning of the leaves, it''s bright and dark.  It''s the parent of dreams (just threw that in).  Many memories stay sharp and clear, but so often they look like this.  Great disposition of colors.  I love how the three trees cooperate in establishing a central balance, anchoring the scene.

<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This lovely image has the feeling of memory.  It fades into but a semblance, it''s there but ungraspable, it''s like the constant turning of the leaves, it''s bright and dark.  It''s the parent of dreams (just threw that in).  Many memories stay sharp and clear, but so often they look like this.  Great disposition of colors.  I love how the three trees cooperate in establishing a central balance, anchoring the scene.

Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-11-14 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
